Expanded validation diagnostics reuse the training-derived numerical research
implementation qualified in the Work Order B generated controls.

Alpha precision and beta recall follow the unembedded equations in Synthcity
(vanderschaarlab/synthcity, commit 23f322fe381326ed01c41b13d469a06e38cce545),
licensed under Apache-2.0. The original complete license and source buffers
are preserved as opaque .txt test fixtures.

The optional DOMIAS result applies the isolated density-ratio equation from
vanderschaarlab/DOMIAS, commit 9527dab320f9d41372e1f67e0d5c2b80becfdd61,
licensed under MIT. Its original complete license and source buffer are also
preserved. It does not run or claim reproduction of the author's complete
training-inclusive attack executable.

Fixtures are used only to extract reference equations in generated-array tests.
Author pipeline modules are never imported. Fixture hashes, sizes, commits and
source URLs are listed in fixtures/expanded-validation-metrics/author-source-pins.json.
